===Verb===
{{en-verb|squibb}}

# To make a sound like a small [[explosion]].
#: ''A [[w:Snider-Enfield|Snider]] '''squibbed''' in the jungle.''
# {{lb|en|colloquial|dated|ambitransitive}} To throw squibs; to utter [[sarcastic]] or [[severe]] [[reflection]]s; to contend in [[petty]] [[dispute]].
#: ''to '''squib''' a little debate''

